OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA blustery day with showers and
OL,6,Fstrong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,7,Fshelter for the Borders, mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith sunshine here and showers
OL,9,Fbecoming more occasional in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining windy and some
OL,13,Fshowers continuing to affect Dumfries
OL,14,Fand Galloway, further east will see
OL,15,Fmore clear spells, feeling quite
OL,16,Fchilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
