OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,6,Fthe day and Autumn sunshine for most
OL,7,Fareas, any showers in the west
OL,8,Fbecoming isolated, quite a pleasant
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,12,Fto start the day on Monday but this
OL,13,Fwill become patchy and feeling a lot
OL,14,Fwarmer, more settled towards the
OL,15,Fmiddle of the week but few showers at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
